# Firstmate is a bash-first agent distro: every tracked text file must reach
# the working tree with LF endings on every platform. A Windows clone under
# git's default core.autocrlf=true would otherwise materialize CRLF scripts,
# which breaks heredoc-generated files, `read` loops over tracked fixtures,
# and byte-exact test comparisons even where bash itself tolerates the \r.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never subject to end-of-line normalization.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
